    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλοζω-ΐα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love of life,</i> esp. of an
			ignoble kind, <i>clinging to life,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ φιλοζωΐαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					15.10.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Andronic.
			</span></i> Rhod.<i><span class="en">
				p.572
			</span></i> M.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τῆς συγγενοῦς φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					6.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἔνδοξον θάνατον τῆς ἀγεννοῦς φ.
					ἠλλάξαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.84
				</span></i>
			.</div>
